# She Cried Against Strangling Hands — Vulture Culture, 2018 (file v3_19,
# <version> 2.0). Gamebook; no published walkthrough; route derived from the
# game source. Each command is a page object name, and every step is a live
# option of the page before it (checked against the echoed option text).
# Subway password "merciless" comes from the film: filmcan (mausoleum, needs
# shovel + seraphim/incubus statues behind the purple/green candle doors) and
# generator (siphoned gasoline) in the projector. The green candle is on the
# sailboat (black key <- safe code 9579 <- obelisk dig <- torn pieces A+B, B
# behind the red candle door). Bell-ringing pickups are skipped: each one adds
# a random Woods Death roll at the outdoor hubs. Ending "Carry The Burden" ->
# Credits, which has no options, so state=Running there is the authored ending.
